@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> SkipNonMeaningfulElements

SkipNonMeaningfulElements --> IgnoreEmptySpacesAndLineBreaksStart
IgnoreEmptySpacesAndLineBreaksStart --> SkipCommentContent
SkipCommentContent --> EndOfBlockComment
EndOfBlockComment --> ContinueSkipping : COMPLETION_EVENT

@enduml
